#: ../../source/reference/stylesheet.rst:13
msgid ""
"The StyleSheet class is responsible for handling CSS style rules, which "
"can be applied to Widget objects. It includes functionality for storing, "
"loading, saving, and resolving styles, along with utility methods to "
"convert CSS color and length values."
msgstr ""

